msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Yasuko「Ufufu, glad Ryuu-chan came along,＿definitelyyy.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ujuju, me alegra que Ryuu-chan haya＿venido, definitivamenteee.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's this all of a sudden?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y eso a qué viene tan de repente?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan's happy we could have this＿talk.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan está feliz de que pudiéramos＿tener esta charla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sorry. Seems like we didn't really＿talk and stuff usually.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Perdón. Parece que normalmente＿no hablábamos mucho ni nada de eso.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh, no no, Yacchan never once＿thought that, but......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ah, no, no, Yacchan jamás＿pensó eso, pero......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Did Ryuu-chan think thattt? Yacchan's＿sorry too, for not making time for ittt.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ryuu-chan pensaba esooo? Yacchan＿lamenta no haber tenido tiempooo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You work hard at your job, so I＿understand.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Te esfuerzas mucho en tu＿trabajo, así que lo entiendo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ehehe, thanks, Ryuu-chan☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ejeje, gracias, Ryuu-chan☆」"
